<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces are advancing in Tigray while militia attacks near the Kenya-Ethiopia border have killed civilians and displaced thousands, pushing refugee numbers above 50,000 in Kenya. Ethiopian drones are operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, leading to diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Ethiopia accuses Eritrea of directing a Tigray rebel offensive with Egyptian support, and Eritrean forces have engaged in drone and artillery strikes near Badme. The army chief has labeled Eritrea a vector of chaos and accused Egypt of supporting the TPLF. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDNLYVFjMzVtckJFOVJ6b2hOaG9VMzFhM3Z0bzdHMkNjYVVwdk1WYVBWc3RUMXFLTmJKNUN2NTJiQmdWYlhpSC1NZmQ0VjJRNElLcTFSTGoyYVN6NE90NHU2Wng0c0hFMk1Qek9FU1E1SDg1dzNnMWJ0RGxTcVBYOExvc3BuNkw2U0paVlZMblFMWF9GTVR2VnBsRlQtaDVjN1otTVcwWU5NMGZYc3ZGUF9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/acc_10nov26_550_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPSlIwbWtjaGVNd0tmR3F3MUZGdC1JTUVxMHdHWUctX1VaYXpUbUZhRTB6OHZjNENOazh3Y3F5YzFuamFuVS1tWVQzRjlobVIwYXRDSVo5UzNSRWZ3MGNBWnJVY09WQmU5aVQwaWJxbzJ2R05SQXJ4RlhCekJEczBsdmxjckctTDQyOWt4TjNKNFdpdnQxQWxlZ0JwYkZmUXlnR1JDb3lYcGFwY2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Railway Gazette International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPTHlpR3QyZmZiSDlNM3NXLTF1TE9qMkVycE1BVWVBX2pIQ1hpX1dfZnJORW9Nbi1Gb2VmWi1nam8xOU5zZHZuN0tPUldJb201cl